ale voice you're now hearing two  female voices I'm not going to say that  I literally could not tell the  difference then there was slight  differences but they were similar enough  that I had a much harder time and it  only it took me a second to figure out  who was talking at a number of points  and that's distracting so yeah like I  said goes from the show to point o skip  it no point but ghost in the shell  definitely see it if you haven't if you  like anime at all you haven't seen this  get off your button actually you may be  interested to check it out anyway  because it is being remade as an  American action will be Scarlett  Johansson's got to be the major I do  have my eye on this and I have mixed  feelings the more that I hear about it  but I'm hopeful we'll see in any case  those are my thoughts on both coasts of  the shell and ghost in the shell 2 point  0 have you seen one or either version of  this movie what were your thoughts on  what was your preference did you like  the changes where you're like me did you  hate them whatever your thoughts about  either version or this movie as a whole  or the remake or whatever drop something  down in the comments and let's talk  about it please feel free to like  subscribe follow me on twitter at  council of geeks check out the council  of geeks podcast on itunes and stitcher  and as for me I'll be back as soon as I  can get my next fix
 

